SUMMARY:ZENITH ARC — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: ZENITH ARC\nRoadshow: https://www.netroadshow.com/nrs/home/#!/?sho
 w=c6c319a2 | Passcode: 26ZENITH\n\nDeal context:\nZenith Arc (a 50.1% Flui
 dstack / 49.9% Next Frontier JV vehicle sitting under Prairieland Rivers L
 LC) is bringing a $2.25 billion 5NC2 Senior Secured Green Notes offering t
 o finance the development of a purpose-built 149 MW critical IT load / 200
  MW gross AI/HPC datacenter campus in Okmulgee\, Oklahoma\, with project c
 apex of ~$2.1bn and $236mm of parent equity alongside the notes. The deal 
 is 100% pre-leased to JS Data Center\, LLC (a Jane Street affiliate) at $1
 47.50/kW/month with 3% annual escalators under a triple-net lease\, implyi
 ng ~$269mm initial annual rent and ~$5.1bn total initial-term lease value\
 , with Jane Street providing a parent guaranty of tenant obligations. Pric
 ing is expected Thursday August 18 following an investor call on August 12
  at 10:30AM ET\; the deal carries a BB expected rating with a price whispe
 r in the high 8s\, structured with DSCR-based semi-annual amortization pos
 t-commencement and a $150mm capped completion guarantee from Prairieland.
